From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fluorite Integration Role
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 23:10:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] filament texture loader: skip mipmap generation for one-level textures

TextureLoader creates image textures with one level, then unconditionally
calls generateMipmaps(). Filament rejects that call because the texture was
not created with GEN_MIPMAPPABLE usage. Keep the existing one-level texture
contract and avoid the invalid generation request.

---
 .../filament_view/core/scene/material/loader/texture_loader.cc | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/material/loader/texture_loader.cc b/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/material/loader/texture_loader.cc
--- a/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/material/loader/texture_loader.cc
+++ b/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/scene/material/loader/texture_loader.cc
@@ -78,1 +78,0 @@ TextureLoader::createTextureFromImage(
-  texture->generateMipmaps(*engine);
 
   return texture;
-- 
2.34.1
